      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.Manager_Email }}",
        "subject": "=Overdue Task Alert – {{ $json.Task_ID }} – {{ $json.Assigned_To }}",
        "message": "=<p>Hello Manager,</p>  <p>The following operational task is overdue and requires your attention.</p>  <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\"> <tr><td><b>Task ID</b></td><td>{{ $json.Task_ID }}</td></tr> <tr><td><b>Task Name</b></td><td>{{ $json.Task_Name }}</td></tr> <tr><td><b>Assigned Employee</b></td><td>{{ $json.Assigned_To }}</td></tr> <tr><td><b>Cycle ID</b></td><td>{{ $json.Cycle_ID }}</td></tr> <tr><td><b>Due Date</b></td><td>{{ $json.Due_Date }}</td></tr> <tr><td><b>Due Time</b></td><td>{{ $json.Due_Time }}</td></tr> </table>  <p>Please review the task and acknowledge the escalation.</p>  <p>Regards,<br>Allo Innoware – AI Operations Manager</p>",
