      "parameters": {
        "content": "# **Workflow 3 – SLA Monitor & Escalation**\n\n**Workflow Name:** AI Operations – 03 – SLA Monitor & Escalation\n\n**Purpose:** Monitors employee task deadlines, identifies overdue tasks, and automatically sends manager alerts while preventing duplicate notifications.\n\n**Trigger:** Every 15 minutes.\n\n**Data Source:** Google Sheets – Employee_Workbench, Task_Master, and Escalation_Log.\n\n**Output:** Manager overdue email alerts and escalation records in Escalation_Log.",
